@host = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### Search - success, returns a page of results with sourceSlug + externalId per item
GET {{host}}/api/catalog/search?keywords=berserk

### Search - with pagination and filters
GET {{host}}/api/catalog/search?keywords=berserk&limit=5&offset=0&nsfw=NONE&status=ONGOING&type=MANGA

### Search - missing required keywords param -> 400 (Bean Validation on the query param binding)
GET {{host}}/api/catalog/search

### Import - success, materializes the Comic (find-or-create), chained into the requests below
# @name importComic
POST {{host}}/api/catalog/myanimelist/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Import - same (sourceSlug, externalId) again -> 200, reuses the already-persisted Comic (no duplicate insert)
POST {{host}}/api/catalog/myanimelist/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Import - unsupported source slug -> 400 (UnsupportedMetadataSourceException, doesn't match the active provider)
POST {{host}}/api/catalog/anilist/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Import - sourceSlug matches the active provider but externalId doesn't exist upstream -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/catalog/myanimelist/999999999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Comic - read by slug, chained from the import above -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}

### Comic - unknown slug -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/comics/does-not-exist
